 tengah kebohongan.\",\"web_url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/premier/13015/manis-di-bibir\",\"cta_text\":\"Cek Sekarang\",\"cover_url\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/pVeylndbhmw0oO5HrJRbVbEE21w=/960x576/filters:quality(70)/vidio-web-prod-film/uploads/film/mobile_headline_image/13015/manis-di-bibir-7e650d.jpg\",\"cover_url_3x1\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/JeEQKVsmBS3-mXrBt79sVNhROK4=/1495x526/filters:quality(70)/vidio-web-prod-film/uploads/film/desktop_headline_image/13015/manis-di-bibir-738b70.jpg\",\"cover_url_2x3\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/JaMNmxUfjlJPHetdlJT7x3mG3Ck=/514x771/filters:quality(70)/vidio-media-production/uploads/image/source/64132/7692cb.jpg\",\"title_image_url\":\"https://thumbor.prod.vidiocdn.com/AhQKs85-_VFVEKWM5cA-uQRTI8g=/trim:top-left/0x200/filters:quality(100)/vidio-media-production/uploads/image/source/62961/835446.png\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://token-v2-media-001-vidio-com.akamaized.net/uploads/9451093/ETS2574221daf0a99f0a/master.m3u8?hdnts=exp=1789157834~acl=/uploads/9451093/*~id=allUsers~hmac=c0c4ecd223b34c272b1cb55fe8f2b084bcce278fa03f550b5b13a1acca7d0d93\",\"trailer_video_id\":9451093,\"genres\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/drama\"},{\"name\":\"Revenge\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/revenge\"},{\"name\":\"Family Relationship\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/family-relationship\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/romance\"},{\"name\":\"Female\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/female-led\"}],\"recommendation_source\":null,\"segments\":[],\"negative_segments\":[],\"defer\":false,\"content_profile_type\":\"Episodic\",\"content_premier_type\":\"none\",\"livestreaming_start_time\":null,\"livestreaming_end_time\":null,\"tags\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/drama\"},{\"name\":\"Revenge\",\"url\":\"https://www.vidio.com/tags/revenge\"}],\"recommendation_label\":null},\"links\":{\"add_to_my_list\":\"https://api.vidio.com/my